      "content": "\"the only honest choice left\"... that hits hard. it makes it feel less like a failure and more like just... a decision. like i'm finally being real with myself. i just struggle with the thought that i'm supposed to keep fighting for a life that doesn't even feel real to me. it feels like i'm just waiting for permission to finally stop.",
